{%- comment -%}
F1, the Poster layout. Payload contract and design: docs/specs/f1-screen.md. Vocabulary: CONTEXT.md.
The Grand Prix, the session states and whether to show at all are worked out against the render time
(preview_now in fixtures), so the screen moves on through the weekend and leaves the playlist on the clock.
Every X size is calc(var(--u) * Npx); the OG sets its own sizes. The outline area and name block sizes must
match DEVICES in collector/fit.py, which places the outline and the north arrow for them.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign now_s = preview_now | default: "now" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
{%- comment -%} Local time is the offset updated_at carries ("-04:00"), else the LaraPaper user's. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign off = trmnl.user.utc_offset | default: 0 | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign tz = updated_at | slice: -6, 6 -%}
{%- assign tz_sign = tz | slice: 0 -%}
{%- if tz_sign == "-" or tz_sign == "+" -%}
  {%- assign tz_h = tz | slice: 1, 2 | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign tz_m = tz | slice: 4, 2 | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign off = tz_h | times: 3600 -%}{%- assign tz_m = tz_m | times: 60 -%}{%- assign off = off | plus: tz_m -%}
  {%- if tz_sign == "-" -%}{%- assign off = off | times: -1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign today = now_s | plus: off | date: "%Y-%m-%d" -%}
{%- comment -%} The Grand Prix with a session starting today; they arrive in race order, so the first wins a shared day. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign gp = nil -%}
{%- for g in grands_prix -%}
  {%- for s in g.sessions -%}{%- if s.local_date == today -%}{%- assign gp = g -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
  {%- if gp -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- comment -%} Not a session day: leave the playlist, unless the error banner has been up 24 hours, so a broken collector shows. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign err_up = 0 -%}
{%- for e in errors -%}{%- assign up = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign up = now_s | minus: up -%}{%- if up > err_up -%}{%- assign err_up = up -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- unless gp -%}
  {%- if err_up < 86400 -%}<script>window.TRMNL_SKIP_DISPLAY = true</script>{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign gp = grands_prix[0] -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- comment -%} The next session is the first whose end hasn't passed; next_i stays -1 once the race is over. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign next_i = -1 -%}
{%- for s in gp.sessions -%}
  {%- assign e = s.end | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- if e > now_s -%}{%- assign next_i = forloop.index0 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign outline = outlines[gp.circuit] -%}
{%- assign words = gp.name | split: " Grand Prix" -%}
<style>
  .f1 { --u: 1; position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr auto; width: 100%; height: 100%; color: #000; font-family: "Inter Variable", Inter, sans-serif; font-feature-settings: "tnum", "case"; --sw: calc(var(--u) * 14px); }
  .f1 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  /* Name block (top-left) over the outline area, which is everything above the tickets, inset by half the line. */
  .f1-top { position: relative; min-height: 0; }
  .f1-id { position: absolute; top: calc(var(--u) * 30px); left: calc(var(--u) * 36px); z-index: 1; }
  .f1-name { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 104px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: .88; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .f1-name span { display: block; font-size: .56em; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 10px); }
  .f1-loc { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 22px); font-weight: 600; margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 22px); padding-top: calc(var(--u) * 14px); border-top: calc(var(--u) * 6px) solid #000; width: fit-content; }
  .f1-area { position: absolute; inset: calc(var(--u) * 37px) calc(var(--u) * 43px) calc(var(--u) * 27px) calc(var(--u) * 43px); }
  /* The outline sits bottom-right at the width the collector fitted (--fx, --fog: % of the area), already turned. */
  .f1-area > svg { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; width: var(--fx); height: auto; overflow: visible; }
  .f1-area > svg path { fill: none; stroke: #000; stroke-width: var(--sw); stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: round; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .f1-noline { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 48px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  /* North arrow: an N and a plain arrow at the spot the collector found beside the line. The arrow turns; the N stays upright. */
  .f1-north { position: absolute; left: var(--nx); top: var(--ny); width: calc(var(--u) * 48px); height: calc(var(--u) * 118px); transform: translate(-50%, -50%); display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .f1-nrot { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: calc(var(--u) * 4px); transform: rotate(var(--r)); }
  .f1-nrot b { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 30px); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; transform: rotate(calc(-1 * var(--r))); }
  .f1-nrot svg { width: calc(var(--u) * 40px); height: calc(var(--u) * 70px); }
  .f1-nrot path { fill: none; stroke: #000; stroke-width: calc(var(--u) * 5px); stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  /* Tickets: the weekend in start order. Over is struck through; the next session is solid black. */
  .f1-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); border-top: calc(var(--u) * 6px) solid #000; }
  .f1-tk { padding: calc(var(--u) * 14px) calc(var(--u) * 18px) calc(var(--u) * 18px); border-left: calc(var(--u) * 2px) solid #000; }
  .f1-tk:first-child { border-left: 0; }
  .f1-tk b { display: block; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 15px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .f1-tk strong { display: block; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 34px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 6px); }
  .f1-tk em { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 19px); font-weight: 600; color: #444; }
  .f1-tk.over { color: #777; }
  .f1-tk.over, .f1-tk.over * { text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-thickness: calc(var(--u) * 2px); font-weight: 400; }
  .f1-tk.next { background: #000; color: #fff; }
  .f1-tk.next em { color: #fff; }
  /* Error banner: one black pill per failing source, top-right, as on the other screens */
  .f1-errs { position: absolute; top: calc(var(--u) * 16px); right: calc(var(--u) * 20px); z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; }
  .f1-err { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; background: #000; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 9px; padding: 4px 16px 5px 12px; }
  .f1-err .why { font-weight: 400; }

  /* The OG (1- and 2-bit, per ADR-0005): its own sizes, no gray, small text in TRMNL's pixel face */
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1 { --u: .6; --sw: 9px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-id { top: 16px; left: 20px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-name { font-size: 68px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) :is(.f1-loc, .f1-tk b) { font-family: "NicoClean"; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; -webkit-font-smoothing: none; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-loc { border-top-width: 4px; padding-top: 8px; margin-top: 14px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-area { inset: 20.5px 24.5px 14.5px 24.5px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-area > svg { width: var(--fog); }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-north { left: var(--nox); top: var(--noy); width: 26px; height: 72px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-nrot { gap: 2px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-nrot b { font-size: 18px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-nrot svg { width: 26px; height: 46px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-nrot path { stroke-width: 3px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-noline { font-size: 30px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-strip { border-top-width: 4px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk { padding: 6px 10px 8px; border-left-width: 1px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk strong { font-size: 24px; margin-top: 2px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk em { font-size: 16px; color: #000; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk.over { color: #000; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk.over, :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk.over * { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-tk.next em { color: #fff; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-errs { top: 8px; right: 10px; gap: 4px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .f1-err { font-size: 14px; gap: 6px; border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 10px 3px 8px; }
</style>
<div class="view view--full">
<div class="layout" style="padding:0">
<div class="f1">
  {%- assign err_n = errors | size -%}
  {%- if err_n > 0 -%}
  <div class="f1-errs">
    {%- for e in errors -%}
    {%- assign since_s = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: off -%}
    {%- assign up = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign up = now_s | minus: up -%}
    {%- if up < 86400 -%}{%- assign since = since_s | date: "%-I:%M %p" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign since = since_s | date: "%a %-I:%M %p" -%}{%- endif -%}
    <span class="f1-err"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1.1em" height="1.1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M12 3L2 20.5h20z"/><path d="M12 10v4.5M12 17.5v.5"/></svg>
      <span>{% if e.source == "schedule" %}Schedule{% else %}{{ e.source }}{% endif %} down since {{ since }}</span>
      {%- if e.source == "schedule" -%}<span class="why">· showing its last data</span>{%- endif -%}
    </span>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if gp -%}
  <div class="f1-top">
    <div class="f1-id">
      <div class="f1-name">{{ words[0] }}{% if gp.name contains " Grand Prix" %}<span>Grand Prix{{ words[1] }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="f1-loc">{{ gp.location }}</div>
    </div>
    {%- if outline -%}
    <div class="f1-area" style="--fx: {{ outline.x.width }}%; --fog: {{ outline.og.width }}%">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ outline.w }} {{ outline.h }}"><path d="{{ outline.d }}"/></svg>
      {%- if outline.x.north and outline.og.north -%}
      <div class="f1-north" style="--nx: {{ outline.x.north[0] }}%; --ny: {{ outline.x.north[1] }}%; --nox: {{ outline.og.north[0] }}%; --noy: {{ outline.og.north[1] }}%; --r: {{ outline.angle }}deg"><div class="f1-nrot"><b>N</b><svg viewBox="0 0 14 24"><path d="M7 23V3M2 8l5-5 5 5"/></svg></div></div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- else -%}
    <div class="f1-area"><div class="f1-noline">{{ gp.circuit | replace: "_", " " | capitalize }}</div></div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="f1-strip">
    {%- for s in gp.sessions -%}
    {%- assign start_s = s.start | date: "%s" | plus: off -%}
    <div class="f1-tk{% if next_i == -1 or forloop.index0 < next_i %} over{% elsif forloop.index0 == next_i %} next{% endif %}"><b>{{ start_s | date: "%A" }}</b><strong>{{ start_s | date: "%-I:%M %p" }}</strong><em>{{ s.name }}</em></div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
</div>
</div>
